; combine and sacrifice them to create your own hybrid fighting style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567800/extras/93dfad1a7982186de73b158d6f46b62e.poster.avif?t=1703269909\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567800/extras/93dfad1a7982186de73b158d6f46b62e.webm?t=1703269909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2567800/extras/93dfad1a7982186de73b158d6f46b62e.mp4?t=1703269909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
